  "limitations": [
    "Current Golemancy regression uses predecessor studies,32+32 theories,input/source/seal/filter/provider contents and advanced display fixtures. It actually pays Mind/components/12Machina, deploys the paid output, configures seals, collects/stores3diamonds, delivers2apples through Provider despite competing Store, follows and picks up exact owned props. No output golem is supplied; gallery designs do not establish all natural acquisition.",
    "Current LateGolem uses explicit predecessor research,arena/loaded navigation region,raw knowledge,input stacks/crystals,aura and physical altar/source fixtures. Actual C2S scans and four research payments precede paid HungryChest/Levitator arcane outputs,75essentia JarBrain infusion with bucket remainder,XP capture/release,paid factory Flyer and elevated physical Collect/Store flight. Finished new outputs are not supplied. These prepared conditions do not establish a complete manual survival campaign.",
    "78 canonical research keys are supported: preserved74 plus HUNGRYCHEST,LEVITATOR,GOLEMFLYER,JARBRAIN. MATSTUDVOID,BASEELDRITCH,ESSENTIATRANSPORT and remaining late/world gates stay closed. Full Golemancy and fullTC6 are not complete.",
    "Infusion preserves56 recipes,now16 implemented research/craft paths,14 established ordinary-source paths and40 late research gates. JarBrain is the only newly accessible path. Firebat/Pech/Primordial Pearl natural world acquisition for Advanced/Greater remains unfinished.",
    "All21 original focus nodes and prior production/Thaumatorium/Hedge/Clockwork/Infusion features are preserved in the full server suite. Separate current client evidence is only the two profiles in clientProfiles;0.23 Golemancy and0.22 GolemPress/EssentiaProduction evidence remains explicitly historical.",
    "Pinned release quirks remain,including partial levitator-buffer final lift debt,refill while powered,opaque-scan boundary inclusion,BrainJar delayed XP recapture,props0 press animation and final blocked-output zero-cost stall. Modern navigation/render buffers/native particles,loaded-only checks,NBT bounds,transaction guards and dictionary-to-tags are documented adaptations.",
    "Natural original zombie brain drop/scan hooks are connected. Brainy catalogue entities and incomplete TC6 world ecology are not a claim of completed natural generation. All hidden-client input desktops stayed Default; no independent-client multiplayer validation is established."
